360	story_opening	{"heading_1": "When we saw Excitement", "heading_2": "Turning Into Overthinking", "paragraphs": ["Elewen was born from noticing a simple truth: many people love the idea of hosting, but hesitate because planning an event often feels like too much to manage.", "Finding reliable vendors, understanding fair pricing, and coordinating everything usually means relying on social media, referrals, and endless back-and-forth."]}	\N
