368	story_opening	{"heading_1": "When we saw Excitement", "heading_2": "Turning Into Overthinking", "paragraphs": ["Elewen was born from noticing a simple truth: many people love the idea of hosting, but hesitate because planning an event often feels like too much to manage.", "Finding reliable vendors, understanding fair pricing, and coordinating everything usually means relying on social media, referrals, and endless back-and-forth."]}	\N
363	thoughtful_gatherings	{"heading": "Thoughtful Gatherings Over Loud Distractions?", "paragraphs": ["With house parties becoming the new way to celebrate, it felt like the right time to bring digitalisation, organisation, and standardisation to the events space.", "Built on trust & to save time, Elewen is a one-stop digital platform that makes hosting simpler with genuine pricing, and seamless planning.", "And that's how Elewen came to be!"]}	\N
364	founders	{"heading": "Meet the Founders", "founders": [{"name": "Hi! I'm Moksha", "paragraphs": ["I still don't fully know how a formerly shy kid has turned into an adult who now builds experiences around people, conversations, and connection, but here we are.", "I've lived a large part of my life at a boarding school, The Lawrence School, Sanawar, which has shaped me into an independent, creative and confident person obsessed with structure (yes, I make checklists in my personal life too). An obsession that turned out to be a superpower in the events world.", "After doing a Msc. In International Events from the UK, and spending years in the industry, I knew I didn't want to build just another event management company. I wanted to create something bigger.", "So, I left my dream job, took a leap of faith and Elewen was born."]}, {"name": "Hey! I'm Gauri", "paragraphs": ["I'm a dancer, reader, dreamer, and a believer that every little step eventually leads to the right place.", "I graduated from Ashoka university with an honours in economics and finance. Post-graduation, I was set to be buried in financial spreadsheets, but life had different plans.", "Elewen began as an idea my co-founder and I developed while exploring the opportunity to build a thoughtful, design-driven brand. Fast forward, and Elewen has grown into a full-time adventure, challenging me every day, keeping me on my toes and constantly inspired."]}]}	\N
365	why_choose	{"heading": "Why Choose Elewen", "features": [{"note": "packages from Rs6k", "label": "Little details that lift your party"}, {"label": "One complete look. Zero running around."}, {"label": "A few clicks and you're done planning"}, {"label": "Behind the scenes? That's on us."}], "subheading": "Everything you need for a beautiful celebration, thoughtfully brought together."}	\N
366	vendor_quality	{"body": "We stand by the people behind every celebration, creating steady work, clear processes, and timely payments for vendors.", "cards": [{"title": "Quality you can trust", "description": "Every partner in the Elewen Network is quality-checked for skill, reliability, and consistency."}, {"title": "Built for everyone involved", "description": "By removing middlemen, we give customers better value and help our partners work in a more organised, digital, and timely system."}, {"title": "Clear tiers. Simple Choices", "description": "Our partners are grouped into three levels. You choose your package, and we take care of the rest."}], "heading": "Our approach to vendor quality"}	\N
